# Skin Mirror — AI Beauty Advisor Prototype

## Context
Prototype demo cho Unilever Vietnam pilot tại Watson HCMC.
Tablet tại kệ Simple, scan da shopper 5 giây, recommend 2 SKU.
Hero feature: Time-lapse Skin Projection — show da shopper sẽ ra sao sau 4 tuần.
Target audience: phụ nữ Việt 22-35 tuổi, shopper Watson HCMC.

## Tech stack
- Vite + React 18 + TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS v3 (đã config sẵn với custom colors)
- Recharts cho data visualization
- Lucide React cho icons
- KHÔNG dùng Next.js
- KHÔNG dùng shadcn components — pure Tailwind only
- KHÔNG suggest thêm package mới (framer-motion, MUI, etc.) trừ khi user yêu cầu

## Custom Tailwind colors đã có sẵn
- text-ink / bg-ink: #1A1A1A (primary text)
- text-muted: #6B7F75 (secondary text)
- text-tertiary: #888780 (subtle text)
- bg-cream: #FAFAF7 (warm white background)
- bg-sand: #F1EFE8 (lighter beige)
- border-line: #E5E5E5 (subtle border)
- text-purple-600 / bg-purple-600: #534AB7 (primary accent)
- bg-purple-50: #EEEDFE (light purple tint)
- bg-purple-900: #26215C (dark purple)

## Design system
- Font heading: font-serif (Georgia)
- Font body: system sans (default)
- Border radius: rounded-md (6px) cho button, rounded-lg (8px) cho card
- Spacing: dùng Tailwind scale (p-4, gap-2, etc.)
- KHÔNG gradient, KHÔNG shadow nặng, KHÔNG animation flashy
- Style: clinical, minimal, trustworthy — không gimmick
- Touch targets ≥ 44px (h-11 minimum cho button)

## UX principles
- Vietnamese UI strings (tiếng Việt cho user-facing text)
- English code (variable names, comments)
- Progressive disclosure: hide complexity behind taps
- Privacy-first messaging cho consent screens

## Code conventions
- Functional components only, no class components
- TypeScript strict, define interfaces cho props
- Tailwind className, không inline style trừ dynamic value
- File naming: PascalCase cho component files (e.g. ScanScreen.tsx)
- One component per file
- useState cho local state, no Redux/Zustand
- Default export cho component chính của file

## When asked to build a component
- Đọc file đã có để hiểu existing pattern trước khi tạo mới
- Generate complete working code, không placeholder
- Include TypeScript types đầy đủ
- Test that it compiles (no unused imports, no `any` types)
- Place trong src/components/ folder
- Don't modify other files unless explicitly asked